 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"T Shirt Order Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a t shirt order form used for?\", \"a\": \"A t shirt order form collects what each buyer wants printed: the style, color, size and quantity, along with their name and how they pay. Organizers use it to total every size for the printer before a print run.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make a tshirt order form online?\", \"a\": \"List the shirts and their prices, then decide when orders close. Describe that to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a> and it builds a tshirt order form that takes payment and keeps a running count per size.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a t-shirt order form template for Word?\", \"a\": \"You can make one in Word in a few minutes with a table that gives each buyer a row and each size a column. Insert drop-down content controls from the Developer tab so the size column only accepts real sizes. Each returned copy still gets added up by hand.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make an order form for T-shirts?\", \"a\": \"Start by deciding who fills it in. When each buyer orders for themselves, an online form works best, with a size and quantity for every style and a date when orders close. When a coach orders for the whole team, a sheet with one row per player and a column per size will do. Either way, ask the printer for its size range and upcharges first.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a printable t shirt order form?\", \"a\": \"Template sites and print shops post free printable versions as PDF files. Pick a shirt order form template with a column for every size you print and room for back printing. Paper still leaves you collecting cash and typing totals into a spreadsheet.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a school t-shirt order form include?\", \"a\": \"Ask for the student's name and homeroom, a youth or adult size, and the quantity. Show the price and the date orders close. A good tshirt order form template for schools also names a contact for size swaps after delivery.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make an editable t-shirt order form template?\", \"a\": \"Save the layout as a Word document, not a PDF or an image, and next year's prices and colors take a minute to change. An online form is editable too: change a price or add a color, and the next buyer sees it.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a merchandise order form?\", \"a\": \"A merchandise order form covers more than shirts, such as hoodies, hats and tote bags, each with its own sizes or colors. Bands and clubs use one to take orders before printing. For goods that are not printed to order, a general order form fits better.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can you fill in a t-shirt order form PDF?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A fillable PDF lets you click the size box and type straight into it. A flat one has no fields, but Acrobat Reader's Fill & Sign tool places typed text anywhere on the page, or you can print it and use a pen.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are t shirt order forms free?\", \"a\": \"Printable t shirt order forms are free on many template sites. Building and publishing one in Emergent costs nothing on the free tier. When the shirt comes with a race entry, ask for the size on the registration form instead of a separate one.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}